{
  "$comment": [
    "The module map. One entry per installable feature. The installers read this;",
    "nothing else decides what a module owns.",
    "",
    "tables  - created by the module schema.sql, dropped by its uninstall",
    "flows   - {source, name, env}: the node file to build from, the name to",
    "          register it under, and the admin .env variable to write its id",
    "          into. env null means the flow is not triggered from the browser.",
    "          Two entries may share a source: one node can serve two flows.",
    "panels  - admin source files copied in, and the tabs they contribute",
    "packs   - ComfyUI custom node packs that must be present",
    "models  - what the module loads on the render host",
    "linksTo - modules this one has an optional foreign key into. Installing one of them re-applies this module's schema so the link is added then.",
    "modelFiles - the model files this module's graphs load, by name. Read out of the flow sources, so it cannot drift from what they ask for. The installer looks for each under <ComfyUI>/models and says which are missing.",
    "needs   - modules that must be installed first"
  ],
